  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n**((3.254 times 3.254 times 3.254)-(0.746 times 0.746 times 0.746))/((3.254 times 3.254)+(0.746 times 0.746)+(3.254 times 0.746))**\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\na³ - b³ = (a - b)(a² + b² + ab)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**((3.254 times 3.254 times 3.254)-(0.746 times 0.746 times 0.746))/((3.254 times 3.254)+(0.746 times 0.746)+(3.254 times 0.746))**\n\n⇒ ((3.254³)-(0.746³))/((3.254²)+(0.746²)+(3.254 times 0.746))\n\n⇒ ((3.254-0.746)((3.254²)+(0.746²)+(3.254 times 0.746)))/((3.254²)+(0.746²)+(3.254 times 0.746))\n\n⇒ (3.254-0.746)\n\n⇒ 2.508\n\n**∴ Option 4 is the correct answer.**",
